{"name": "Skull and Bones", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/85c342d191f2735ce83cdd3fbcd5c80e.webp?t=1787141592\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/85c342d191f2735ce83cdd3fbcd5c80e.avif?t=1787141592\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><br/>Experience fast, tactical, and explosive ship-to-ship battles built around positioning, timing, and powerful weapon loadouts.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/2bb4719ef3db7298922ee37fc41c8cb8.poster.avif?t=1787141592\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/2bb4719ef3db7298922ee37fc41c8cb8.webm?t=1787141592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/2bb4719ef3db7298922ee37fc41c8cb8.mp4?t=1787141592\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/d93db91de6c20de59bd2d66f84ee7014.webp?t=1787141592\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/d93db91de6c20de59bd2d66f84ee7014.avif?t=1787141592\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><br/>Command a variety of unique ship classes \u2013 each with distinct roles, perks, and strengths. Customize your vessel to reflect your strategy and playstyle.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" po